{
"recipe_id":"19 Homemade Rice Ice Cream",
"source_text":"1. 将 170g 熟米饭、250g 牛奶和 15g 白糖混合并搅打。根据想要的口感控制搅打程度：细腻米糊约 1 分钟，保留半颗粒口感约 30 秒。\n2. 将 200g 淡奶油和 15g 白糖打发至约六分发，即出现纹路但很快消失。\n3. 将米糊、打发淡奶油以及约 30g 整颗熟米饭混合搅拌均匀。\n4. 倒入不锈钢容器，放入冷冻层。\n5. 每隔约 1 小时取出搅拌一次，并把容器边缘已经冻结的部分一起搅入，以减少冰晶。\n6. 重复搅拌约 3 次，之后继续冷冻约 3 小时。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "将 170g 熟米饭、250g 牛奶和 15g 白糖混合", "text_en": "Add 250 g of milk to 170 g of cooked rice for mixing with 15 g of sugar.", "start_char": 3, "end_char": 31, "node_indices": [1, 2], "edge_indices": [1], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "将 170g 熟米饭、250g 牛奶和 15g 白糖混合", "text_en": "Add 15 g of sugar to the 170 g of cooked rice for mixing with 250 g of milk.", "start_char": 3, "end_char": 31, "node_indices": [1, 3], "edge_indices": [2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 2, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "将 170g 熟米饭、250g 牛奶和 15g 白糖混合", "text_en": "Combine 170 g of cooked rice, 250 g of milk, and 15 g of sugar.", "start_char": 3, "end_char": 31, "node_indices": [1, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 3, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "搅打。根据想要的口感控制搅打程度：细腻米糊约 1 分钟，保留半颗粒口感约 30 秒。", "text_en": "Blend the mixture, adjusting the blending to the desired texture: about 1 minute for a smooth rice paste, or about 30 seconds to retain a partly grainy texture.", "start_char": 32, "end_char": 73, "node_indices": [4, 5], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 4, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "将 200g 淡奶油和 15g 白糖打发至约六分发，即出现纹路但很快消失。", "text_en": "Add 15 g of sugar to 200 g of heavy cream before whipping it to about the stage at which visible trails quickly disappear.", "start_char": 77, "end_char": 114, "node_indices": [6, 7], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 5, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "打发至约六分发，即出现纹路但很快消失。", "text_en": "Whip until about the stage at which visible trails quickly disappear.", "start_char": 95, "end_char": 114, "node_indices": [6, 8], "edge_indices": [6], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 6, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "将米糊、打发淡奶油以及约 30g 整颗熟米饭混合", "text_en": "Add the whipped cream to the rice paste for mixing with about 30 g of whole cooked rice grains.", "start_char": 118, "end_char": 142, "node_indices": [5, 8], "edge_indices": [7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 7, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 7, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "将米糊、打发淡奶油以及约 30g 整颗熟米饭混合", "text_en": "Add about 30 g of whole cooked rice grains to the rice paste for mixing with the whipped cream.", "start_char": 118, "end_char": 142, "node_indices": [5, 9], "edge_indices": [8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "混合搅拌均匀。", "text_en": "Mix and stir until evenly combined.", "start_char": 140, "end_char": 147, "node_indices": [5, 10], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 9, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 9, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "放入冷冻层。", "text_en": "Place it in the freezer to freeze.", "start_char": 159, "end_char": 165, "node_indices": [10, 11], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 10, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "每隔约 1 小时取出搅拌一次", "text_en": "Take it out and stir once at intervals of about 1 hour.", "start_char": 169, "end_char": 183, "node_indices": [10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18], "edge_indices": [10, 11, 13, 15, 17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 10, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 11, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 11, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 13, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 15, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 17, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "并把容器边缘已经冻结的部分一起搅入", "text_en": "Stir in the portions that have already frozen around the container’s edges.", "start_char": 184, "end_char": 201, "node_indices": [12, 13], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 12, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 12, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "重复搅拌约 3 次", "text_en": "Repeat the stirring about three times.", "start_char": 212, "end_char": 221, "node_indices": [13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19], "edge_indices": [13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 13, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 14, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 14, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 15, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 16, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 16, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 17, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 18, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "之后继续冷冻约 3 小时。", "text_en": "Afterward, continue freezing for about 3 hours.", "start_char": 222, "end_char": 235, "node_indices": [19, 20], "edge_indices": [19], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 19, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 19, "role": "output"}]}],
